{"title":"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the smallest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/6328626c798db7376fab1311956cb25126ae8cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> is larger than 300?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can first set up an inequality:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b8930ca0a058e60945054bd31afa7180771a0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 3n &gt; 300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/a/d3aa53ef4b94114b75a44ce504c1506858420bb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n &gt; 300 - 5 = 295$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"156\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/5/ea597d013c4637b1329f04972e03b7e0aa92ab0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 99 = 297$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/e/dfe4d431e3c2b7dbfd1f77f3ff728eefe024ed88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 98 = 294$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/8/d68d74ac4225272073e3924f2c49a78e17bf99b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> goes above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/969b04ece5cbdcc540b6a6d92f69a6add8843ee1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$295$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/a/4ca83153f096e7ba2d44f8fbf7e73737474c6696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 98$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> goes below <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/969b04ece5cbdcc540b6a6d92f69a6add8843ee1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$295$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so the smallest number such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/6328626c798db7376fab1311956cb25126ae8cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> goes above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b899aba26cc33f0026125daebb44a60349c999b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f548634abf6ca28473a8f572df02a60c23db8bcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{99}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC\">2015 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems (page